{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mnemograph is a turn-based strategy and card game with roguelike elements. Upgrade your printing plant, strengthen your deck, and become the most powerful newspaper tycoon in this corrupt city!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924080/extras/0dbf7d0fb506aa79d11a83b1a95cc054.avif?t=1764583691\" width=1024 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Council has just lifted the press ban. Four newspapers compete to dominate the city, including yours. But <i>The Mnemograph Chronicle</i> isn\u2019t an ordinary daily\u2014it\u2019s written by a machine that extracts the memories of the dead: The Mnemograph.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 game mode (Standard Mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 characters (The Crime Lord, The Politician, The Industrialist, and The Arms Dealer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Character cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 Equipment cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Event cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Standard Action cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >District Capture cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 different printing plant upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine maintenance system</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2924080?t=1764583691","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924080/7d241ca0f28ed5756aca59127605b4a27a9242a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764583691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924080/6eab2f2275bc1b3d2d8653d76def4af6d84b0b2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764583691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akam